 confrontation between Shido and his friends Ratatoskr and DEM has begun. Kurumi and her clone, AST led by Ryoko Kusabe, join them, and as the battle intensifies, Shido confronts a horde of pseudo-Spirits, Nibeelcole.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/olRLWEJ1k9PcNwpC2esrDHcXt1i.jpg"},{"title":"Lo Spirito Primitivo","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":5,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17476","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"151380","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"52196","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"46004","scope":"s5","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"264663","scope":"s5","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"80042","synopsis":"A certain time, a certain place. Shinji Takamiya encounters a spatial earthquake, but finds a girl at the scene. She remembers almost nothing about herself. Shinji gives her the name Mio and she goes to live with him and his younger sister, Mana.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zhMUk9eFUhR6EdHKNkWAycvnz0x.jpg"},{"title":"Mio, la madre","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":5,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17476","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"151380","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"52196","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"46004","scope":"s5","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"264663","scope":"s5","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"80384","synopsis":"Shido is flooded with memories as the girl named Mio Takamiya stands before him. She was the person with whom Shido once shared his feelings when he was Shinji Takamiya. Meanwhile, Kotori and the others learn of Reine's true identity.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qjxp9TgyHuHMBuUhSYoOwvYavGi.jpg"},{"title":"I tre maghi","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNum